{"server":"cn","storyId":"act4d0_level_act4d0_st04","groupId":"act4d0","stageId":null,"title":"存续公正","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act4d0/level_act4d0_st04.txt","sourceHash":"ae9bfe9c9d75f9d1e7e5ade80bac14c4a8d928728e4d8cb22d8affe5a73584b6","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"拉特兰公证所派出执行者送葬人，前往叙拉古执行委托。\n送葬人找到了委托目标红云，遵循委托，他将带其前往罗德岛接受治疗。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第一关（前）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"♪你是否听闻一声惊雷？\n♪雨成帘，不见山\n♪我早已忘记是何人何物\n♪将我引领入此道\n♪远方的红色的云啊\n♪带我回到故乡"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"narration","text":"10:37 A.M.    天气/多云\n叙拉古天灾低发区，荒野，某林中小屋"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经听见了歌声，躲藏是不必要的，我没有恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......每个刽子手都是这么说的。但最后，总是见血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"刽子手？我不明白你的用词。我是拉特兰公证所——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！你骗不了我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"得手了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"失礼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"目标翻窗逃走，反应相当迅速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"环境确认。腌制的羽兽肉，鞣制用的架子，处理过的牙兽皮，手工小刀和木质工具。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"放下弓。我清楚你的位置，你埋伏在窗后。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"重申一遍，我对你没有恶意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"——不行！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"你的警戒心很强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"尝尝这一箭！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"抓，用手抓住了箭身？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......你究竟是什么人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"诚如报告所说，遗嘱继承人暴躁排外，难以交流。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"以上就是本人遗嘱的全部内容。\n除此之外，我有一条出于私心的请求。\n在叙拉古的森林之中，我遇到了一位独臂的沃尔珀少女。\n她沉溺在对过去的复仇之中，拘泥于那片染血的土地。\n出于怜悯，我帮助了她，也许这伤害到了她的自尊，但她倔强的求生方式的确感动了我。\n后来我意识到，我一时兴起的援助，不过是坚定了她复仇的执念，这让我寝食难安。\n所以我想把我的一切赠送给她，尽管我几乎一无所有，只剩那么点可悲的遗物。\n——恕我打断一下，您的亲属列表里没有沃尔珀人。这会为我们的工作带来很多麻烦。\n所以，这只是一位膝下无子的拉特兰公民，在将死之际向公证所提出的小小请求。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的身上，有血的气味，而且，有股讨厌的感觉......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"（又是来破坏我们家园的人吗，讨厌，好讨厌！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"上钩了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此，又是个陷阱。似乎各个方位都有触发机关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"听着！你已经走进了猎人的陷阱，不想死的话，就把你的武器放下，一步也不要动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能方便交流，可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰公证所的执行者，本次的遗嘱执行人。可以称呼我“送葬人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"“红云”，你是被委托的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么会知道我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"你的名字由遗嘱人迪伦马特先生告知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"我不认识这个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"出于某些原因，他曾使用多个化名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你要带我去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"出于保密要求，我不能说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁，满嘴谎话！你就死在这里吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不会离开这儿的，我的爸爸妈妈，叔叔阿姨，还有朋友，我的族人，都，都......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我的任务只是带你离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"不要再说胡话了！你知道自己的处境吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我处在无法进行交涉的情况下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，走进这片森林的，都只会是我们的猎物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脚下的骨头，原本都是些野兽和坏人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"理解。据点周围布满陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"落穴，绊索，土制地雷，自动飞镖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"请放心，我已经全部解除了。陷阱很初级，有伤到委托对象你的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"请跟我走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"——！走开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前一步，我就射穿你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"又逃了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你为什么要救我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟我也是个猎人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看到一位可敬的同行失去了一只臂膀，血肉模糊地躺在一只牙兽的身边，我怎么能视而不见呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......你根本不是猎人，你骗不了我。你身上没有泥土的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，瞒不过你，但亲眼目睹那副景象的时候，我被年幼却征服了荒野的你感动了，这是实话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是我的自言自语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你脑袋上的那个圆，还有背后的装饰，是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小家伙，你没见过拉特兰人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......我抛却的故土给我留下的印记。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"人是没法抛弃家的泥土的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许吧，总之，发生了很多事，来，试着站起身来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让我来帮你装上这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......？胳膊？铁做的胳膊？好奇怪的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"代表我对一位荒野之子的敬意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你是个修东西的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很久以前的职责让我学会了很多东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......你救过我，你不是个坏人。为了报仇，我很需要一只胳膊，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"复仇吗......我不会指点你的命运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但当你用这只手臂拉动弓弦的时候，你可以想想，除了报仇以外，我们是为什么活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想得少了，就会沦落到我今天这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不要说什么“为了复仇而活”，这太老套了，很没意思的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老猎人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......没错，很没意思的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉特兰......他说他是拉特兰人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"（难道他真的是......)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！又来，好痛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"看来迪伦马特先生的判断是正确的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，你是什么时候追到这里的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！放开我！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"停手吧，既然你是遗嘱继承人，我就不能伤害你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"这是他的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么还要抵抗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......信上有他的气味，血的气味，你对他做了什么！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"从拉特兰抵达这里的旅程非常漫长，气味分子不可能有所保留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"回答我！否则你会死在这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，我认为展示力量差距有助于对话成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，出于对遗嘱继承人的尊重，我可以回答你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"迪伦马特先生死在手术台上，并不安详。他身患一种无法治愈的疾病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！松手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"这是他的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！你，你在干嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"源石已经破体而出，感染程度在加剧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"这不关你事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"如果执行对象坚持拒绝，原则上，我可以放弃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"但委托人和上司给予了我一个附属条约，我必须执行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"——你到底要怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"“让红云活下去”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"但因为要求笼统，所以实行起来很复杂，希望你能配合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......这也是那个人的委托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。他变卖了所有的财产，支付了包括公证所的额外手续费，以及你将来的治疗开销。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，为什么？他只是路过这片森林......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"他想让你活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我问为什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他觉得你值得活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"既然遗嘱已经传达到位，我的工作就告一段落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"什......！你什么时候塞给我的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"在下一步行动前，我必须听到你的答复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"“你想活下去吗？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要回答，想，或是不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的时间不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"对了，先生，我该怎么称呼你？\n——送葬人。如果你执意要称呼我的话。\n非常感谢你愿意接受我的委托。\n——是中庭公证所做出了决定，我只是履行职责。\n哈哈，也是。在你寻找红云的过程中，我还有一个小小的请求。\n——视情况，我可能会拒绝你的口头诉求。希望你以纸面申请的形式递交公证所。\n先生可真是不留情面，没关系，只是一个小小的要求。\n不要告诉她关于我的过去，随便编个借口吧，比如，我死在了手术台上？\n——我不明白这其中的必要性，这也不符合你的身份。你逃避公证所多年，而且你枪杀了......\n打住。如果我说，这能为你的工作省去很多麻烦呢？\n——如果我判断的确如此的话，我会考虑尝试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，那个叫罗德岛的地方，真的能治疗这种奇怪的病？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"没有人能够抵抗矿石病。但也许可以缓解痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑到你先前对那些乌萨斯人所做的一切，我不建议你单独行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"而我正好要去罗德岛履行另一份协议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在邀请我和你同行？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为这十分合理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"我还有很多事情要做，在离开这片土地之前，我要与族人们道别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"这里很危险，仇恨并不会因为一方的妥协而终结。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......你知道得很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"无论你怎么说，别妨碍我。等到一切结束，我会去那个......罗德岛的，这样就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我在考虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑如果那些亡命之徒再次找到你，我的子弹储备是否充足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"子弹......？不，你的意思是要陪着我回到荒漠！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"根据你的回答，你已被公证所视作接受遗嘱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"但遗嘱内容尚未履行完成，我不能放任你就这么暴露在危险中。这是我的义务。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要你的帮助！我一直都是一个人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我认为你有故意妥协，然后趁机逃走的可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"那么事不宜迟，我们出发吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！我没有答应你！我不需要你这种外人来......等等，你要去哪儿？你怎么知道那个方向的！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"调查的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"你脚下有——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"送葬人","speakerId":"char_279_excu","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经解除了陷阱，请跟上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红云","speakerId":"char_190_clour","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊——你这个怪人，我迟早要让你好看——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"请一定要照顾好她，送葬人先生。当然，也许对你而言也是一件好事。\n别摆出一副不理解的表情，你会明白的。\n希望你们能让她脱离泥泞。别让她像我一样。\n正义？也许我的所作所为是有正当性的吧，先生，如果公证所能够谅解我的话。\n但那依旧不是什么值得称赞的事情，相反，正因如此，才让人生显得荒谬之极。\n但她是我的遗产。\n是我的希望。\n愿主保佑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_190_clour","aliases":["红云"]},{"speakerId":"char_279_excu","aliases":["？？？","送葬人"]}]}
